       <item>
        <widget class="QLabel" name="label_alpha">
         <property name="font">
          <font>
           <family>Times New Roman</family>
           <pointsize>16</pointsize>
           <weight>75</weight>
           <italic>false</italic>
           <bold>true</bold>
          </font>
         </property>
         <property name="toolTip">
          <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Roboto,Ubuntu,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Hiragino Sans GB,Microsoft YaHei UI,Microsoft YaHei,Source Han Sans CN,sans-serif'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039); background-color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;控制&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei'; font-size:14px; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039);&quot;&gt;Wasserstein距离正则化&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Roboto,Ubuntu,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Hiragino Sans GB,Microsoft YaHei UI,Microsoft YaHei,Source Han Sans CN,sans-serif'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039); background-color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;的强度，影响不同任务模型参数之间的相似性。通常较小，如 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039);&quot;&gt;0.01, 0.1, 1.0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Roboto,Ubuntu,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Hiragino Sans GB,Microsoft YaHei UI,Microsoft YaHei,Source Han Sans CN,sans-serif'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039); background-color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;。可在大范围（如&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039);&quot;&gt;[0.001, 0.01, 0.1, 1, 10]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Roboto,Ubuntu,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Hiragino Sans GB,Microsoft YaHei UI,Microsoft YaHei,Source Han Sans CN,sans-serif'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039); background-color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;）内搜索。值越大，算法越鼓励不同任务的模型参数（&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039);&quot;&gt;W+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Roboto,Ubuntu,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Hiragino Sans GB,Microsoft YaHei UI,Microsoft YaHei,Source Han Sans CN,sans-serif'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039); background-color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;和&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039);&quot;&gt;W-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Roboto,Ubuntu,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Hiragino Sans GB,Microsoft YaHei UI,Microsoft YaHei,Source Han Sans CN,sans-serif'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039); background-color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;）通过Wasserstein距离向共同的重心（&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039);&quot;&gt;Wb+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Roboto,Ubuntu,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Hiragino Sans GB,Microsoft YaHei UI,Microsoft YaHei,Source Han Sans CN,sans-serif'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039); background-color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;和&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039);&quot;&gt;Wb-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Roboto,Ubuntu,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Hiragino Sans GB,Microsoft YaHei UI,Microsoft YaHei,Source Han Sans CN,sans-serif'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039); background-color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;）聚集，​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei'; font-size:14px; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039);&quot;&gt;增强任务间的一致性&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Roboto,Ubuntu,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Hiragino Sans GB,Microsoft YaHei UI,Microsoft YaHei,Source Han Sans CN,sans-serif'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039); background-color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;。值过小可能使各任务模型近乎独立训练。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
         </property>
         <property name="styleSheet">
          <string notr="true">QLabel {
    border: 1px solid rgb(70, 130, 180);   /* 增强为科研蓝边框，参考Nature期刊图表色 */
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 4px 8px;
    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);  /* 纯白背景提升对比度 */
    color: rgb(30, 80, 120);               /* 深海军蓝文字，对比度达8:1 */
    font: bold 16pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;     
    qproperty-alignment: 'AlignCenter';
    /* 强化阴影效果 */
}

QLabel:hover {
    border-color: rgb(0, 100, 180);        /* 悬停时使用更高饱和的科研蓝 */
    background-color: rgb(240, 248, 255);  /* 极浅蓝悬停反馈 */
}

QLabel:pressed {
    background-color: rgb(220, 240, 255);  /* 按压状态模拟墨水渗透效果 */
}</string>
         </property>
         <property name="text">
          <string>alpha</string>
         </property>
        </widget>
       </item>
       <item>
        <widget class="QLabel" name="label_beta">
         <property name="font">
          <font>
           <family>Times New Roman</family>
           <pointsize>16</pointsize>
           <weight>75</weight>
           <italic>false</italic>
           <bold>true</bold>
          </font>
         </property>
         <property name="toolTip">
          <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Roboto,Ubuntu,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Hiragino Sans GB,Microsoft YaHei UI,Microsoft YaHei,Source Han Sans CN,sans-serif'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039); background-color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;控制&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei'; font-size:14px; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039);&quot;&gt;L1正则化（LASSO）​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Roboto,Ubuntu,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Hiragino Sans GB,Microsoft YaHei UI,Microsoft YaHei,Source Han Sans CN,sans-serif'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039); background-color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;​ 的强度，直接影响模型的特征选择能力。通常较小，如 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039);&quot;&gt;0.01, 0.1, 1.0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Roboto,Ubuntu,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Hiragino Sans GB,Microsoft YaHei UI,Microsoft YaHei,Source Han Sans CN,sans-serif'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039); background-color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;。可在大范围（如&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039);&quot;&gt;[0.001, 0.01, 0.1, 1, 10]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Roboto,Ubuntu,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Hiragino Sans GB,Microsoft YaHei UI,Microsoft YaHei,Source Han Sans CN,sans-serif'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039); background-color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;）内搜索。值越大，对系数绝对值的惩罚越重，越多特征系数会被&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei'; font-size:14px; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039);&quot;&gt;压缩至0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Roboto,Ubuntu,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Hiragino Sans GB,Microsoft YaHei UI,Microsoft YaHei,Source Han Sans CN,sans-serif'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039); background-color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;，模型越稀疏（特征选择更激进）。这是实现特征选择的关键。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
         </property>
         <property name="styleSheet">
          <string notr="true">QLabel {
    border: 1px solid rgb(70, 130, 180);   /* 增强为科研蓝边框，参考Nature期刊图表色 */
