       <item>
        <widget class="QLabel" name="label_tol">
         <property name="toolTip">
          <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Roboto,Ubuntu,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Hiragino Sans GB,Microsoft YaHei UI,Microsoft YaHei,Source Han Sans CN,sans-serif'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039); background-color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;算法整体优化的&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei'; font-size:14px; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039);&quot;&gt;收敛容差&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Roboto,Ubuntu,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Hiragino Sans GB,Microsoft YaHei UI,Microsoft YaHei,Source Han Sans CN,sans-serif'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039); background-color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;。当参数更新变化小于此阈值，则认为已收敛。较小的正数，如 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039);&quot;&gt;1e-4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Roboto,Ubuntu,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Hiragino Sans GB,Microsoft YaHei UI,Microsoft YaHei,Source Han Sans CN,sans-serif'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039); background-color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt; 或 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039);&quot;&gt;1e-3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Roboto,Ubuntu,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Hiragino Sans GB,Microsoft YaHei UI,Microsoft YaHei,Source Han Sans CN,sans-serif'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039); background-color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;。值越小，收敛判定越严格，解可能更精确，但所需迭代次数可能更多。需与&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039);&quot;&gt;max_iter&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Roboto,Ubuntu,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Hiragino Sans GB,Microsoft YaHei UI,Microsoft YaHei,Source Han Sans CN,sans-serif'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039); background-color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;配合调整。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
         </property>
         <property name="styleSheet">
          <string notr="true">QLabel {
    border: 1px solid rgb(70, 130, 180);   /* 增强为科研蓝边框，参考Nature期刊图表色 */
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 4px 8px;
    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);  /* 纯白背景提升对比度 */
    color: rgb(30, 80, 120);               /* 深海军蓝文字，对比度达8:1 */
    font: bold 16pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;     
    qproperty-alignment: 'AlignCenter';
    /* 强化阴影效果 */
}

QLabel:hover {
    border-color: rgb(0, 100, 180);        /* 悬停时使用更高饱和的科研蓝 */
    background-color: rgb(240, 248, 255);  /* 极浅蓝悬停反馈 */
}

QLabel:pressed {
    background-color: rgb(220, 240, 255);  /* 按压状态模拟墨水渗透效果 */
}</string>
